cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or data, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Genetic and hydrodynamic connectivity in Australian coral reef species: a meta-analysis"
abstract: >
  R code and data for a meta-analysis of pairwise FST-based genetic connectivity
  and Lagrangian hydrodynamic connectivity across Australian coral reef species.
  Covers isolation-by-distance analysis, marker-type effects on FST, variance
  partitioning, genetic and hydrodynamic network analysis, and concordance
  assessment between the two connectivity frameworks across 20 biogeographic
  regions of Australia.
